#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/feral_wizards.json
msgid ""
"A mage gone feral, their bloodshot eyes looking to and fro as eldritch light "
"occasionally trails from their hands.  The arcane sigils on their clothing "
"and the rings and jewelry they wear bespeak that they were once a mage of "
"considerable power before the Cataclysm took their mind."
