#. ~ Description of monster "warg"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/goblin.json
msgid ""
"An enormous wolf, a meter and a half high at the shoulder, as large as a "
"young horse.  Tamed wargs were common as pets before the Cataclysm, but this "
"one looks anything but tame."
msgstr ""

