#. ~ Description of monster "bugbear"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/goblin.json
msgid ""
"An enormous gray-green humanoid, over two meters tall with thick fur at their"
" joints and long, tufted ears, this creature no longer has much resemblance "
"to a goblin other than the color.  Despite their size, they move in almost "
"complete silence and hold a long bladed weapon in their hand."
msgstr ""

