#. ~ Description of monster "lizardfolk chieftain"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/lizardfolk.json
msgid ""
"Among the lizardfolk, ambition is a rare quality.  Chieftains earn their "
"place by exhibiting unusually high levels of ambition, often mistaken by "
"outsiders as excessive, brutal violence.  This chief is the largest and "
"strongest member of its tribe and carries a fierce trident to compliment its "
"teeth and claws."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/mi-go.json
