"Will-o'-wisps can be yellow, white, green, or blue.  They are easily mistaken"
" for lanterns, especially in the foggy marshes and swamps where they reside."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "will-o-wisp"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s glitters in an eerie pattern."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "troll"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
msgid ""
"A monstrous, green-skinned humanoid, almost three meters tall but as thin as "
"the average human.  Trolls are renowned for their thick hides and natural "
"regenerative ability."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
