#. ~ Description of monster "rock troll"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
msgid ""
"A monstrous, gray-skinned humanoid, almost three meters tall but as thin as "
"the average human.  Rock trolls have rocky skin that's almost impervious to "
"hand weapons, but they turn to stone in the sunlight."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Death message of monster "rock troll"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s turns to stone."
msgstr ""

