msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#. ~ Description of monster "otyugh"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
msgid ""
"An enormous, bulbous body dominated by a toothy maw, with three tentacles "
"extending from the top.  Two tentacles are tipped with grasping filaments and"
" the last has several dark spots that might be eyes.  It smells indescribably"
" foul."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/monsters.json
