#. ~ Description of monster "dryad"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/nature_spirits.json
msgid ""
"You would have thought this was a tree until it suddenly moved.  It is human-"
"shaped and human-sized, but with wood for skin and leaves for hair.  It "
"regards you impassively."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Death message of monster "dryad"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/nature_spirits.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s collapses into splinters."
msgstr ""

