"A walking tree, slowly moving on a tangle of roots like a land-bound octopus,"
" with its branches swaying in the wind.  There is the vague suggestion of a "
"face in the whorls of its bark."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Death message of monster "treant"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/nature_spirits.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s returns to immobility."
