"An enormous stag with a body made of wood and vines, this is the king of the "
"forest.  Its ivy-wreathed horns bloom with flowers and grass grows with every"
" step that it takes.  Two luminous green eyes gaze at its surroundings."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Death message of monster "keeper of the glades"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/nature_spirits.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s collapses into a massive pile of splinters."
