#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "keeper of the glades"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/nature_spirits.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s rears and roots burst from the ground!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "keeper of the glades"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/nature_spirits.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%1$s's viridian eyes blaze as it stares at the unnatural creatures nearby!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "keeper of the glades"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/nature_spirits.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%1$s's viridian eyes blaze and grasping roots drag the unnatural creature "
"down beneath the soil!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
