"A small mass of animate stone in the rough shape of a human, with clay for "
"joints.  Two gemstone eyes stare at you without blinking."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Death message of monster "gnome"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/nature_spirits.json
