#. ~ Description of monster "ogre mage"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/ogre.json
msgid ""
"An enormous, blue beast known for living in swamps and eating passersby, "
"slightly smaller than the other ogres you've seen.  This ogre has a more "
"calculating look.  As it idly waves the hand not holding a club, you see "
"sparkles trail through the air after its fingers."
msgstr ""

