#. ~ Description of monster "orc warrior"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/orcs.json
msgid ""
"Like a goblin, but stretched and exaggerated until they're as tall as a human"
" but much more heavily muscled, wearing improvised armor and carrying a "
"spear."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "orc archer"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/orcs.json
msgid ""
"Like a goblin, but stretched and exaggerated until they're as tall as a human"
" but much more heavily muscled, wearing improvised armor and carrying a bow."
"  They smile silently, baring a set of sharp teeth, as they aim at you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "orc archer"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/orcs.json
msgid "The orc shoots you with laser accuracy!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/orcs.json
