#. ~ Description of monster "thaumic zombie"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/zombies.json
msgid ""
"A human body, swaying as it moves, an unstoppable rage visible in its oily "
"black eyes.  Faint blue lines are visible beneath parts of its exposed skin, "
"letting off an eldritch glow."
msgstr ""
